    [206387]={status="ok",name="Kajaric Icon",quality=2,tip="Item Level 25Binds when picked upUniqueRelicTotemClasses: ShamanEngrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune:You hurl molten lava at the target, dealing (71.4% of Spell Power) Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst deals 20% increased damage.\"Learn a new ability after taking damage from lava 5 times. (Reduces damage from some sources of lava)\""},
