    [208414]={status="ok",name="Lunar Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 5Binds when picked upUniqueRelicIdolClasses: DruidEngrave your chest or robe with the Fury of Stormrage rune:Reduces the mana cost of Wrath by 100% and each time you deal damage with Wrath you have a 12% chance for your next cast of Healing Touch within 15 sec to be instant and castable in any shapeshift form. Allows Wrath to be cast while in Tree of Life form.\"Defeat 6 creatures affected by your Moonfire, then use to learn a new ability.\""},
    [208689]={status="ok",name="Ferocious Idol",quality=2,tip="Item Level 20Binds when picked upUniqueRelicIdolClasses: DruidEngrave your pants with the Savage Roar rune:Requires Cat FormFinishing move that increases Physical damage done by 30% while in Cat Form. Lasts longer per combo point: 1 point : (14 + 0) seconds 2 points: (19 + 0) seconds 3 points: (24 + 0) seconds 4 points: (29 + 0) seconds 5 points: (34 + 0) seconds\"Deal 20 instances of bleeding damage to humanoids, then use this idol to learn a new ability.\""},
